lect the best move from the Valid Moves list above. You can choose to pass even if you have valid moves that can beat the previous play, but you cannot pass if you are in a Free Play (no last play).\nEnsure your response matches one of the valid moves exactly.\nRemember to provide Explanation, Reason, and Answer.", 'reasoning': "**Prioritizing a Winning Strategy**\n\nNow I have determined the optimal move. Analyzing the board, I've confirmed that playing the ♦8 is the only viable option, as it is my last card. I considered any potential opponent plays, but because I am on a free play, there is no need to anticipate responses. My victory is assured.\n\n\n", 'output': 'Evaluation: I hold only one card, the ♦8. Since I just won the previous round with a 2 and both opponents passed, I have the right to lead (Free Play).\n\nReason: Playing my last card will empty my hand and secure the victory immediately.\n\nAnswer: {"cards": ["♦8"]}'}
